Package: com.example.mfprobe
Name: MFProbe Diagnostic
Version: 0.4.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: One-shot runtime diagnostic for MultiFloat (NOT the tweak). Read-only scan of SpringBoard. v0.4.0 adds: (1) whole-image scan to locate third-party floating-window classes (SSFloatingManager / SSFloatingWindow / SSFloatingRootViewController) and their defining dylib; (2) full method/ivar dump of the scene + presenter pipeline (_UIScenePresenter / UIScenePresentationManager / SBDeviceApplicationSceneEntity ...); (3) read-only LIVE probe of running scenes; (4) log-only passthrough hooks on the SpringBoard open-request entries. Writes to /var/mobile. Install, collect the logs, then uninstall.
Maintainer: QingC12 <QingC12@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: QingC12
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
